"""Pages made for a question people type into a search box (31차): one ready-made Korean food card per page,
and one page that says what works in Korea without a Korean phone number.

Rules for this file:
- A page exists only if people search for it (Google autocomplete, read 2026-11-25) and the page does something an answer box can't:
  a card to hand over, staff answers in Korean, dated status per service.
- Every claim has a source in SRC or moments.SRC and the day it was read. Lines without a source are advice ("ask"), never a claim about Korea.
- The status on the phone-number page is not written here. It comes from the guides, so it can never disagree with them.
- No medical advice. Cards say what a person can't or doesn't eat; the only health step is "call 119".
- zh-cn is written by hand.
"""
